function.description:
Query the maximum capacity and current actual registered user count for a given class session.

Args:
    session_id (str): The ID of the class session to check.

Returns:
    dict:
        - On success:
            {
                "success": True,
                "data": {
                    "capacity": int,            # Maximum allowed registrants
                    "registered_count": int     # Actual number of registered users
                }
            }
        - On failure:
            {
                "success": False,
                "error": str                   # Reason for failure (class session not found)
            }

Constraints:
    - session_id must correspond to an existing class session

